    "detail": "解：∵$a⊕(-6b)$<br>$=3a-(-6b)$<br>$=3a+6b$，<br>∴$3a+6b=-2\\frac{1}{4}$，<br>∴$a+2b=-2\\frac{1}{4}\\div 3=-\\frac{3}{4}$．<br>则：$(2a+b)⊕(2a-5b)$<br>$=3(2a+b)-(2a-5b)$<br>$=6a+3b-2a+5b$<br>$=4a+8b$<br>$=4(a+2b)$<br>$=4\\times (-\\frac{3}{4})$<br>$=-3$，<br>故选：$B$．"
