    "detail": "解：∵$\\triangle APQ$是等边三角形，<br>∴$AP=PQ=AQ$，$\\angle APQ=\\angle AQP=60^\\circ$，<br>∴$BP=PQ=QC$，<br>∴$AP=BP$，$AQ=CQ$，<br>∴$\\angle B=\\angle BAP$，$\\angle C=\\angle CAQ$，<br>$\\because \\angle B+\\angle BAP=\\angle APQ=60^\\circ$，$\\angle C+\\angle CAQ=\\angle AQP=60^\\circ$，<br>∴$\\angle B=30^\\circ$，$\\angle C=30^\\circ$，<br>$\\therefore \\angle BAC=180^\\circ -\\angle B-\\angle C=180^\\circ -30^\\circ -30^\\circ =120^\\circ$．<br>故选：A．"
