    "detail": "解：$\\because \\triangle ABC$是等边三角形，点$E$在$AC$上，<br>$\\therefore AB=AC$，$\\angle BAE=60^\\circ$，<br>在$\\triangle ABE$和$\\triangle ACD$中，<br>$\\begin{cases}AB=AC \\\\ \\angle 1=\\angle 2 \\\\ BE=CD\\end{cases}$，<br>$\\therefore \\triangle ABE\\cong \\triangle ACD(SAS)$，<br>$\\therefore AE=AD$，$\\angle BAE=\\angle CAD=60^\\circ$，<br>$\\therefore \\triangle AED$是等边三角形，<br>$\\therefore \\angle AED=60^\\circ$，<br>$\\therefore \\angle CED=180^\\circ -\\angle AED=120^\\circ$，<br>故答案为：$120^\\circ$．"
