    "detail": "（1）解：∵一元二次方程 $x^{2}-6x-15=0$的两根为$x_{1}$，$x_{2}$，<br>则：$x_{1}+x_{2}=6$，$x_{1}\\cdot x_{2}=-15$；<br>（2）解：∵一元二次方程 $2x^{2}-4x+1=0$的两个根为$x_{1}$，$x_{2}$，<br>∴$x_{1}+x_{2}=2$，$x_{1}x_{2}=\\frac{1}{2}$，<br>∴$\\frac{1}{x_{1}}+\\frac{1}{x_{2}}=\\frac{x_{1}+x_{2}}{x_{1}x_{2}}=\\frac{2}{\\frac{1}{2}}=4$；<br>（3）解：∵$x_{1}$，$x_{2}$是关于x的方程$x^{2}-(2m+1)x+m^{2}+1=0$的两个实数根<br>∴$x_{1}+x_{2}=2m+1$，$x_{1}x_{2}=m^{2}+1$，<br>∵$x_{1}+x_{2}=x_{1}\\cdot x_{2}-3$，<br>∴$2m+1=m^{2}+1-3$，<br>∴$m^{2}-2m-3=0$，<br>解得：$m=3$或$m=-1$，<br>∵$\\Delta ={[-(2m+1)]}^{2}-4(m^{2}+1)\\ge 0$，<br>解得：$m\\ge \\frac{3}{4}$，<br>∴$m=-1$不符合题意，$m=3$."
