    "detail": "解：如图，过点$F$作$FH\\perp BC$于点$H$，<br><img src=\"assets/images/ch25_3_g_q10_img9.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\"><br>∵在矩形$ABCD$中，$BC=2AB=8$，$G$是$BC$的中点，<br>∴$CD=AB=4$，$CG=4$<br>∴$\\triangle CDG$是等腰直角三角形，<br>∴$DG=\\sqrt{2}CD=4\\sqrt{2}$，<br>又∵$FH\\perp BC$<br>∴$\\triangle GFH$是等腰直角三角形，<br>∴$FH=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}FG$<br>设$BE=x$，<br>当$E$在$G$点的左侧时，$GE=BG-BE=4-x$，<br>∵$DF=\\sqrt{2}GE=\\sqrt{2}(4-x)=4\\sqrt{2}-\\sqrt{2}x$<br>∴$FG=DG-DF=\\sqrt{2}x$<br>∴$FH=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}FG=x$<br>∴$EH=EG+GH=4-x+x=4$<br>∴$S_{\\triangle AEF}=S_{梯形ABHF}-S_{\\triangle ABE}-S_{\\triangle EFH}$<br>$=\\frac{1}{2}(4+x)(4+x)-\\frac{1}{2}\\times 4x-\\frac{1}{2}\\times 4x$<br>$=\\frac{1}{2}(16+8x+x^{2})-4x$<br>当$\\triangle AEF$的面积是10时，<br>$\\frac{1}{2}(16+8x+x^{2})-4x=10$<br>解得：$x=2$（负值舍去）<br>如图，当$E$在$G$点的右侧时，<br><img src=\"assets/images/ch25_3_g_q10_img10.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\"><br>$GE=BE-BG=x-4$，<br>∵$DF=\\sqrt{2}GE=\\sqrt{2}(x-4)=\\sqrt{2}x-4\\sqrt{2}$<br>∴$FG=DG-DF=4\\sqrt{2}-(\\sqrt{2}x-4\\sqrt{2})=8\\sqrt{2}-\\sqrt{2}x$<br>∴$FH=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}FG=(8-x)$<br>∴$EH=GH-EG=8-x-(x-4)=12-2x$<br>∴$S_{\\triangle AEF}=S_{梯形ABHF}-S_{\\triangle ABE}-S_{\\triangle EFH}$<br>$=\\frac{1}{2}(8-x+4)(x+12-2x)-\\frac{1}{2}\\times 4x-\\frac{1}{2}\\times (12-2x)(8-x)$<br>$=-\\frac{1}{2}x^{2}+24$<br>当$\\triangle AEF$的面积是10时，<br>$-\\frac{1}{2}x^{2}+24=10$<br>解得：$x=2\\sqrt{7}$（负值舍去）<br>当点$E$在$H$的右侧时，不合题意；<br>综上所述，$x=2$或$x=2\\sqrt{7}$,<br>故答案为：2或$2\\sqrt{7}$．"
