    "detail": "解：根据路程$=$速度$\\times$时间得：$CE=3t cm$，$AD=4t cm$，<br>则$CD=AC-AD=(8-4t)cm$，<br>$\\because \\triangle CDE$的面积等于四边形$ABED$的面积的$\\frac{1}{3}$，<br>$\\therefore \\triangle CDE$面积等于$\\triangle ABC$面积的$\\frac{1}{4}$，<br>$\\therefore \\frac{1}{2}CE\\cdot CD=\\frac{1}{4}\\times \\frac{1}{2}AC\\cdot BC$，<br>即$\\frac{1}{2}\\times 3t\\times (8-4t)=\\frac{1}{4}\\times \\frac{1}{2}\\times 8\\times 6$，<br>解得$t_{1}=t_{2}=1$．<br>$\\therefore$当$t=1$秒时，$\\triangle CDE$的面积等于四边形$ABED$的面积的$\\frac{1}{3}$．<br>故答案为：$1$．"
