    "detail": "（1）证明：$\\because DE\\perp AB$，$DF\\perp AC$，$\\therefore \\angle E=\\angle DFC=90^{\\circ}$，<br>在 $\\text{Rt}\\triangle BED$ 和 $\\text{Rt}\\triangle CFD$ 中，<br>$\\begin{cases}BD=CD \\\\ BE=CF\\end{cases}$，<br>$\\therefore \\text{Rt}\\triangle BED\\cong \\text{Rt}\\triangle CFD\\ (\\text{HL})$，<br>$\\therefore DE=DF$，<br>又 $\\because DE\\perp AB$，$DF\\perp AC$，<br>$\\therefore AD$ 平分 $\\angle BAC$；<br>（2）解：由（1）知，$\\text{Rt}\\triangle BED\\cong \\text{Rt}\\triangle CFD$，$\\therefore BE=CF$，<br>在 $\\text{Rt}\\triangle ADE$ 与 $\\text{Rt}\\triangle ADF$ 中，<br>$\\begin{cases}AD=AD \\\\ DE=DF\\end{cases}$，<br>$\\therefore \\text{Rt}\\triangle ADE\\cong \\text{Rt}\\triangle ADF\\ (\\text{HL})$，<br>$\\therefore AE=AF$，<br>$\\because AF=AC-FC=15-FC$，$AE=AB+BE=10+BE$，$BE=CF$，<br>$\\therefore 15-BE=10+BE$，<br>$\\therefore 2BE=5$，解得 $BE=\\frac{5}{2}$．",
