    "sectionNumber": 9,
    "grade": "初二",
    "type": "calc",
    "typeName": "解答题",
    "difficulty": "较难",
    "knowledge": "全等三角形综合问题、全等的性质和SAS综合（SAS）、角平分线性质的实际应用、等腰三角形的性质和判定",
    "chapter": "14.1 全等三角形的判定与性质",
    "stem": "【问题背景】如图1，$\\triangle ABC$与$\\triangle ADE$均为等腰直角三角形，其中$\\angle BAC=\\angle DAE=90^{\\circ}$，$AB=AC$，$AD=AE$．\n【构建联系】<br><img src=\"assets/images/g8_lh_mid_q23_img37.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\"><br>（1）如图2，连接$BE、CD$交于点$F$，探究$BE$与$CD$数量和位置关系；\n【深入探究】\n（2）如图3，在（1）的基础上连接$CE$，连接$FA$并延长$FA$交$CE$于点$G$，\n①求证：$FG$平分$\\angle CFE$；\n②若$FE=3cm$，$FC=4cm$，则$\\triangle CFG$的面积为______$cm^{2}$；\n【知识拓展】\n（3）如图4，连接$CE、BD$，$H$是$BD$的中点，连接$AH$，求证：$CE=2AH$．",
    "options": [],
    "answer": "（1）$CD=BE$，$BE\\perp CD$；<br>（2）$①$证明：过$A$分别作$AM\\perp CD，AN\\perp BE，$垂足分别为$M$，$N$，<br><img src=\"assets/images/g8_lh_mid_q23_img38.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\"><br>$\\because \\triangle ACD\\cong \\triangle ABE$，<br>$\\therefore S_{\\triangle ACD}=S_{\\triangle ABE}$，$CD=BE$，<br>$\\because S_{\\triangle ACD}=\\frac{1}{2}CD\\cdot AM$，$S_{\\triangle ABE}=\\frac{1}{2}BE\\cdot AN$，<br>$\\therefore \\frac{1}{2}CD\\cdot AM=\\frac{1}{2}BE\\cdot AN$，<br>$\\because CD=BE$，<br>$\\therefore AM=AN$，<br>$\\because AM\\perp CD$，$AN\\perp BE$，<br>$\\therefore A$点在$\\angle CFE$的平分线上，<br>$\\therefore FG$平分$\\angle CFE$；<br>$②\\frac{24}{7}$；<br>（3）证明：延长$AH$至点$K，$使得$HK=AH，$连接$BK$，<br><img src=\"assets/images/g8_lh_mid_q23_img39.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\"><br>$\\because H$是$BD$的中点，<br>$\\therefore BH=HD$，<br>在$\\triangle BHK$和$\\triangle DHA$中，<br>$\\begin{cases}BH=HD \\\\ \\angle BHK=\\angle DHA \\\\ AH=HK\\end{cases}$，<br>$\\therefore \\triangle BHK\\cong \\triangle DHA(SAS)$，<br>$\\therefore \\angle KBH=\\angle ADH$，$BK=AD$，<br>$\\because AD=AE$，<br>$\\therefore BK=AE$，<br>$\\because \\angle KBH=\\angle ADH$，<br>$\\therefore BK\\parallel AD$，<br>$\\therefore \\angle ABK+\\angle BAD=180^{\\circ}$，<br>$\\because \\angle CAB=\\angle DAE=90^{\\circ}$，<br>$\\therefore \\angle CAE+\\angle BAD=180^{\\circ}$，<br>$\\therefore \\angle ABK=\\angle CAE$，<br>在$\\triangle ABK$和$\\triangle CAE$中<br>$\\begin{cases}AB=AC \\\\ \\angle ABK=\\angle CAE \\\\ BK=AE\\end{cases}$，<br>$\\therefore \\triangle ABK\\cong \\triangle CAE(SAS)$，<br>$\\therefore CE=AK$，<br>$\\because AK=AH+HK=2AH$，<br>$\\therefore CE=2AH$。",
    "analysis": "（1）先利用$\\angle BAC=\\angle DAE=90^{\\circ}$，推出$\\angle CAD=\\angle BAE$，再结合$AC=AB$、$AD=AE$，用$SAS$证明$\\triangle ACD\\cong \\triangle ABE$，得到$CD=BE$．<br>再由全等三角形的对应角相等，结合三角形内角和或外角性质，证明$\\angle CFB=90^{\\circ}$，从而得到$BE\\perp CD$．<br>（2）①过$A$作$AM\\perp CD$、$AN\\perp BE$，由$\\triangle ACD\\cong \\triangle ABE$得面积相等，结合$CD=BE$推出$AM=AN$，再根据角平分线的判定定理证明$FG$平分$\\angle CFE$．<br>②先由$FE=3cm$、$FC=4cm$及$BE\\perp CD$，求出$\\triangle CFE$的面积；再根据角平分线的性质，设点$G$到$CF$、$EF$的距离均为$h$，利用$S_{\\triangle CFE}=S_{\\triangle CFG}+S_{\\triangle EFG}$列方程求出$h$，进而计算$\\triangle CFG$的面积．<br>（3）延长$AH$至点$K$，使$HK=AH$，连接$BK$，先由$SAS$证明$\\triangle BHK\\cong \\triangle DHA$，得到$BK=AD=AE$且$BK\\parallel AD$，再推出$\\angle ABK=\\angle CAE$，结合$AB=AC$证明$\\triangle ABK\\cong \\triangle CAE$，从而得到$CE=AK=2AH$．",
    "detail": "解：（1）$\\because \\angle BAC=\\angle DAE=90^{\\circ}$，<br>$\\therefore \\angle BAC+\\angle BAD=\\angle DAE+\\angle BAD$，<br>$\\therefore \\angle CAD=\\angle BAE$，<br>在$\\triangle ACD$和$\\triangle ABE$中，<br>$\\begin{cases}AC=AB \\\\ \\angle CAD=\\angle BAE \\\\ AD=AE\\end{cases}$，<br>$\\therefore \\triangle ACD\\cong \\triangle ABE(SAS)$，<br>$\\therefore CD=BE$，<br>$\\because \\triangle ACD\\cong \\triangle ABE$，<br>$\\therefore \\angle ACD=\\angle ABE$，<br>$\\because \\angle ACD+\\angle CAB=\\angle ABE+\\angle CFB$，<br>$\\therefore \\angle CFB=\\angle CAB=90^{\\circ}$，<br>$\\therefore BE\\perp CD$；<br>（2）①证明：如图，过点$A$分别作$AM\\perp CD$，$AN\\perp BE$，垂足分别为$M,N$，<br><img src=\"assets/images/g8_lh_mid_q23_img38.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\"><br>∵$\\triangle ACD\\cong \\triangle ABE$，∴$S_{\\triangle ACD}=S_{\\triangle ABE}$，$CD=BE$，∴$\\frac{1}{2}CD\\cdot AM=\\frac{1}{2}BE\\cdot AN$，∴$AM=AN$．又∵$AM\\perp CD$，$AN\\perp BE$，∴点$A$在$\\angle CFE$的平分线上，即$FG$平分$\\angle CFE$；<br>②$\\because \\angle CFE=90^{\\circ}$，$FE=3cm$，$FC=4cm$，<br>$\\therefore S_{\\triangle CFE}=\\frac{1}{2}\\times FC\\times FE=\\frac{1}{2}\\times 4\\times 3=6cm^{2}$，<br>$\\because FG$平分$\\angle CFE$，$G$在$FG$上，<br>$\\therefore$点$G$到$CF$和$EF$的距离相等，设为$h$，<br>$\\because S_{\\triangle CFE}=S_{\\triangle CFG}+S_{\\triangle EFG}$，<br>$\\therefore 6=\\frac{1}{2}\\times 4\\times h+\\frac{1}{2}\\times 3\\times h$，<br>$\\therefore 6=\\frac{7}{2}h$，<br>$\\therefore h=\\frac{12}{7}cm$，<br>$\\therefore S_{\\triangle CFG}=\\frac{1}{2}\\times 4\\times \\frac{12}{7}=\\frac{24}{7}{cm}^{2}$；<br>（3）证明：如图，延长$AH$至点$K$，使得$HK=AH$，连接$BK$，<br><img src=\"assets/images/g8_lh_mid_q23_img39.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\"><br>∵$H$是$BD$的中点，∴$BH=HD$．在$\\triangle BHK$和$\\triangle DHA$中，$BH=HD$，$\\angle BHK=\\angle DHA$，$HK=AH$，∴$\\triangle BHK\\cong \\triangle DHA\\ (\\text{SAS})$，∴$\\angle KBH=\\angle ADH$，$BK=AD=AE$，∴$BK\\parallel AD$，∴$\\angle ABK+\\angle BAD=180^{\\circ}$．又∵$\\angle CAB=\\angle DAE=90^{\\circ}$，∴$\\angle CAE+\\angle BAD=180^{\\circ}$，∴$\\angle ABK=\\angle CAE$．在$\\triangle ABK$和$\\triangle CAE$中，$AB=AC$，$\\angle ABK=\\angle CAE$，$BK=AE$，∴$\\triangle ABK\\cong \\triangle CAE\\ (\\text{SAS})$，∴$CE=AK=2AH$．"
