    "detail": "解：如图，作$M$关于$OB$的对称点$M^{′}$，$N$关于$OA$的对称点$N^{′}$，连接$M^{′}N^{′}$交$OA$于$Q$，交$OB$于$P$，则$MP+PQ+QN$最小，<br><img src=\"assets/images/ch15_1_1_g_q9_img2.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\"><br>$\\therefore \\angle OPM=\\angle OPM^{′}=\\angle NPQ$，$\\angle OQP=\\angle AQN^{′}=\\angle AQN$，<br>$\\therefore \\angle QPN=\\frac{1}{2}(180^{\\circ}-α)=\\angle AOB+\\angle MQP=30^{\\circ}+\\frac{1}{2}(180^{\\circ}-β)$，<br>$\\therefore 180^{\\circ}-α=60^{\\circ}+(180^{\\circ}-β)$，<br>$\\therefore β-α=60^{\\circ}$．"
