    "stem": "如图，在$\\triangle ABC$中，$AB=5$．<br><img src=\"assets/images/ch15_1_2_l2_g_q11_img1.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\"><br>（1）求作$BC$的垂直平分线，分别交$AB$，$BC$于点$D$，$E$（要求：尺规作图，不写作法，保留作图痕迹）；<br>（2）连结$AE$，若$\\triangle ABE$的周长比$\\triangle ACE$的周长大$2$，求$AC$的长．",
    "options": [],
    "answer": "（1）如图，$DE$即为所求，<br><img src=\"assets/images/ch15_1_2_l2_g_q11_img2.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\"><br>（2）$AC=3$",
