    "detail": "（1）略．<br>（2）解：∵$BC$的垂直平分线$DE$交$BC$于点$E$，<br><img src=\"assets/images/ch15_1_2_l2_g_q11_img3.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\"><br>∴$BE=CE$，<br>∵$C_{\\triangle ABE}-C_{\\triangle ACE}=2$，<br>∴$(AB+AE+BE)-(AE+CE+AC)=2$，<br>∴$AB-AC=2$，<br>∵$AB=5$，<br>∴$AC=3$．"
