    "stem": "（2015·广东汕尾·中考真题）本题满分10分．（为方便答题，可在答题卡上画出你认为必要的图形）<br>如图，过原点的直线<img src=\"assets/images/ch27_inv_lin_q25_img1.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\">和<img src=\"assets/images/ch27_inv_lin_q25_img2.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\">与反比例函数<img src=\"assets/images/ch27_inv_lin_q25_img3.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\">的图象分别交于两点A，C和B，D，连结AB，BC，CD，DA．<br><img src=\"assets/images/ch27_inv_lin_q25_img4.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\"><img src=\"assets/images/ch27_inv_lin_q25_img5.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\"><br>（1）四边形ABCD一定是四边形；（直接填写结果）<br>（2）四边形ABCD可能是矩形吗？若可能，试求此时k$_{1}$和k$_{2}$之间的关系式；若不可能，说明理由；<br>（3）设P（<img src=\"assets/images/ch27_inv_lin_q25_img6.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\">，<img src=\"assets/images/ch27_inv_lin_q25_img7.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\">），Q（<img src=\"assets/images/ch27_inv_lin_q25_img8.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\">，<img src=\"assets/images/ch27_inv_lin_q25_img9.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\">）（x$_{2}$> x$_{1}$> 0）是函数<img src=\"assets/images/ch27_inv_lin_q25_img10.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\">图象上的任意两点，<img src=\"assets/images/ch27_inv_lin_q25_img11.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\">，<img src=\"assets/images/ch27_inv_lin_q25_img12.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\">，试判断<img src=\"assets/images/ch27_inv_lin_q25_img13.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\">，<img src=\"assets/images/ch27_inv_lin_q25_img14.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\">的大小关系，并说明理由．",
