    "answer": "（1）平行（2）四边形ABCD可以是矩形，$k_{1}k_{2}=1$（3）a＞b",
    "analysis": "",
    "detail": "试题分析：（1）根据直线与反比例函数的对称性可得OA=OC，OB=OD，因此可判断出是平行四边形；<br>（2）可猜测可以是矩形，然后根据矩形的性质可得OA=OB，然后由正比例函数<img src=\"assets/images/ch27_inv_lin_q25_img15.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\">和反比例函数<img src=\"assets/images/ch27_inv_lin_q25_img16.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\">相交于A点，可知$k_{1}x=\\frac{1}{x}$，因此$x^{2}=\\frac{1}{k_{1}}$，$y^{2}=k_{1}$，同理可得$x^{2}=\\frac{1}{k_{2}}$，$y^{2}=k_{2}$，<br>因此可得$\\frac{1}{k_{1}}$+$k_{1}_{=}\\frac{1}{k_{2}}$+$k_{2}$，由此可求出$k_{1}k_{2}=1$；<br>（3）由反比例函数的可得$y_{1}=\\frac{1}{x_{1}},y_{2}=\\frac{1}{x_{2}}$，然后根据a-b可判断出a、b的大小．<br>试题解析：解：（1）平行<br>（2）四边形ABCD可以是矩形，此时$k_{1}k_{2}=1$<br>理由如下： 当四边形ABCD是矩形时，OA=\"OB\"<br>OA$^{2=}$x$^{2}$+y$^{2=}\\frac{1}{k_{1}}$+k$_{1}$，OB$^{2=}$x$^{2}$+y$^{2=}\\frac{1}{k_{2}}$+k$_{2}$，<br>∴$\\frac{1}{k_{1}}$+k$_{1=}\\frac{1}{k_{2}}$+k$_{2}$，得（k$_{2}$–k$_{1}$）（$\\frac{1}{k_{1}k_{2}}$-1）=0<br>∵k$_{2}$–k$_{1}$≠0，∴$\\frac{1}{k_{1}k_{2}}$–1=0<br>∴$k_{1}k_{2}=1$<br>所以四边形ABCD可以是矩形，此时k$_{1}$k$_{2}$=1<br>（3）a＞b<br>理由：∵a – b=$\\frac{y_{1}+y_{2}}{2}$-$\\frac{2}{x_{1}+x_{2}}$=$\\frac{1}{2}$（$\\frac{1}{x_{1}}$+$\\frac{1}{x_{2}}$）-$\\frac{2}{x_{1}+x_{2}}$<br>=$\\frac{(x_{1}+x_{2})^{2}-4x_{1}x_{2}}{2x_{1}x_{2}(x_{1}+x_{2})}$=<img src=\"assets/images/ch27_inv_lin_q25_img17.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\"><br>∵$x_{2}$>$x_{1}$>0，<br>∴$(x_{1}-x_{2})^{2}$＞0，$2x_{1}x_{2}(x_{1}+x_{2})$＞0<br>∴<img src=\"assets/images/ch27_inv_lin_q25_img18.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\">＞0<br>∴a＞b<br>考点：正比例函数，反比例函数的图像与性质"
