    "detail": "（1）解：如图，$\\odot  O$即为所求作的$\\triangle  ABC$的外接圆．<br><img src=\"assets/images/ch29_1_2_t_q13_img2.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\"><br>（2）解：如图，连接$OB$．<br>$\\because  AB=AC$，$AD\\perp  BC$，$BC=4$，<br>$\\therefore  BD=CD=2$．<br>设$\\odot  O$的半径为$r$，则$OA=OB=r$，$OD=5-r$．<br>在$Rt\\triangle  BOD$中，由勾股定理得$OB^{2}=OD^{2}+BD^{2}$，即$r^{2}=(5-r)^{2}+2^{2}$，<br>解得$r=\\frac{29}{10}$，<br>$\\therefore  \\odot  O$的半径$r=\\frac{29}{10}$．"
