    "detail": "解：如图，过点 $O$ 作 $OH\\perp AB$，交 $AB$ 于点 $C$，交 $\\odot O$ 于点 $H$，<br><img src=\"assets/images/ch29_2_1_g_q11_img2.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\"><br>设筒车的半径为 $r m$，则 $OA=OH=r m$，<br>$\\therefore OC=(r-2) m$．<br>$\\because OH\\perp AB$，$\\therefore AC=BC=\\frac{1}{2}AB=4 m$．<br>在 $Rt\\triangle OAC$ 中，$OC^{2}+AC^{2}=OA^{2}$，<br>$\\therefore (r-2)^{2}+4^{2}=r^{2}$，解得 $r=5$，<br>$\\therefore$ 筒车的直径是 $10 m$．<br>故选：B．"
