    "detail": "解：过点 $O$ 作 $OH\\perp AB$ 于点 $H$，连接 $OA$、$OC$，如图，则 $AH=BH$，$CH=DH=\\frac{1}{2}CD=2$，<br><img src=\"assets/images/ch29_2_1_t_q6_img2.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\"><br>设 $OC=r$，则 $OA=2r$．<br>$\\because AC=4$，$\\therefore AH=AC+CH=6$．<br>$\\therefore OH^{2}=OC^{2}-CH^{2}=r^{2}-2^{2}$，$OH^{2}=OA^{2}-AH^{2}=4r^{2}-6^{2}$，<br>$\\therefore r^{2}-2^{2}=4r^{2}-6^{2}$，解得 $r=\\frac{4\\sqrt{6}}{3}$ 或 $r=-\\frac{4\\sqrt{6}}{3}$（舍去），<br>即小圆半径是 $\\frac{4\\sqrt{6}}{3}$．<br>故答案为：$\\frac{4\\sqrt{6}}{3}$．"
