    "detail": "（1）证明：如图，过点 $O$ 作 $OE\\perp AB$ 于点 $E$，<br><img src=\"assets/images/ch29_2_1_t_q9_img2.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\"><br>$\\because OE\\perp AB$，$\\therefore AE=BE$，$CE=DE$，<br>$\\therefore AE-CE=BE-DE$，即 $AC=BD$；<br>（2）解：如图，连接 $AO$、$CO$．<br>$\\because AO=10$，$OE=3$，$\\therefore AE=\\sqrt{AO^{2}-OE^{2}}=\\sqrt{91}$．<br>$\\because CO=6$，$OE=3$，$\\therefore CE=\\sqrt{CO^{2}-OE^{2}}=3\\sqrt{3}$，<br>$\\therefore AC=AE-CE=\\sqrt{91}-3\\sqrt{3}$．"
