    "detail": "（1）证明：$\\because AB$ 是 $\\odot O$ 的直径，$C$ 为 $\\odot O$ 上一点，$\\therefore \\angle ACB=90^{\\circ}$，$\\therefore \\angle ACD=90^{\\circ}-\\angle BCE$．<br>$\\because AD=AC$，$\\therefore \\angle ACD=\\angle ADC$．<br>$\\because \\angle CAB+\\angle ACD+\\angle ADC=180^{\\circ}$，$\\therefore \\angle CAB+2(90^{\\circ}-\\angle BCE)=180^{\\circ}$，即 $\\angle CAB=2\\angle BCE$．<br>$\\because \\angle BOE=2\\angle BCE$，$\\therefore \\angle A=\\angle BOE$；<br>（2）解：如图，连接 $OC$．<br><img src=\"assets/images/ch29_2_3_l1_g_q12_img2.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\"><br>由（1）可知 $\\angle BOE=\\angle A=30^{\\circ}$．$\\because \\angle BOC=2\\angle A=60^{\\circ}$，$\\therefore \\angle COE=\\angle BOC+\\angle BOE=90^{\\circ}$．<br>$\\because AB=8$，$\\therefore OC=OE=4$，$\\therefore CE=\\sqrt{OC^{2}+OE^{2}}=4\\sqrt{2}$．"
