    "detail": "解：$\\because PA$、$PB$分别与$\\odot O$相切于$A$、$B$两点，<br>$\\therefore PA=PB=9$，<br>$\\because DA$、$DC$分别与$\\odot O$相切于$A$、$C$两点，$EB$、$EC$分别与$\\odot O$相切于$B$、$C$两点，<br>$\\therefore DA=DC$，$EB=EC$，<br>$\\therefore \\triangle PDE$的周长为$PD+DE+PE=PD+DC+EC+PE=PD+DA+EB+PE=PA+PB=9+9=18$．<br>如图所示，连接$OA$、$OB$、$OP$，<br><img src=\"assets/images/ch30_1_2_l2_b_q9_img2.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\"><br>$\\because PA$、$PB$分别与$\\odot O$相切于$A$、$B$两点，$\\angle APB=50^{^{\\circ}}$，<br>$\\therefore OA\\perp AP$，$OB\\perp BP$，$\\angle APO=\\angle BPO=\\frac{1}{2}\\angle APB=\\frac{1}{2}\\times 50^{^{\\circ}}=25^{^{\\circ}}$，<br>在$Rt\\triangle APO$中，$\\angle AOP=90^{^{\\circ}}-\\angle APO=90^{^{\\circ}}-25^{^{\\circ}}=65^{^{\\circ}}$，<br>同理，$\\angle BOP=65^{^{\\circ}}$，<br>$\\therefore$劣弧$\\overset{\\frown}{ACB}$所对的圆心角$\\angle AOB=65^{^{\\circ}}+65^{^{\\circ}}=130^{^{\\circ}}$，<br>$\\therefore$优弧$\\overset{\\frown}{AB}$所对的圆心角为$360^{^{\\circ}}-130^{^{\\circ}}=230^{^{\\circ}}$，<br>由圆周角定理得$\\angle ACB=\\frac{1}{2}\\times 230^{^{\\circ}}=115^{^{\\circ}}$．<br>故选：D．"
