    "detail": "解：$\\because PA$、$PB$分别切$\\odot O$于$A$、$B$两点，<br>$\\therefore OA\\perp PA$，$PA=PB$，<br>在$Rt\\triangle OAP$中，$\\angle OAP=90^{^{\\circ}}$，$\\angle APO=30^{^{\\circ}}$，$OA=3$，<br>$\\therefore OP=2OA=6$，<br>由勾股定理得$PA=\\sqrt{OP^{2}-OA^{2}}=\\sqrt{6^{2}-3^{2}}=3\\sqrt{3}$，<br>$\\therefore PB=PA=3\\sqrt{3}$．<br>故答案为：$3\\sqrt{3}$．"
