    "detail": "解：如图，连接$BD$，<br><img src=\"assets/images/ch30_1_2_l2_g_q9_img2.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\"><br>$\\because CB$、$CD$分别切$\\odot O$于点$B$、$D$，<br>$\\therefore CB=CD$，$\\angle CBD=\\angle CDB$．<br>$\\because \\angle C=70^{^{\\circ}}$，$\\therefore \\angle CBD=\\frac{1}{2}\\times (180^{^{\\circ}}-70^{^{\\circ}})=55^{^{\\circ}}$．<br>$\\because AB$是$\\odot O$的直径，$CB$是$\\odot O$的切线，<br>$\\therefore AB\\perp BC$，即$\\angle ABC=90^{^{\\circ}}$，<br>$\\therefore \\angle ABD=\\angle ABC-\\angle CBD=90^{^{\\circ}}-55^{^{\\circ}}=35^{^{\\circ}}$，<br>$\\therefore \\angle AED=\\angle ABD=35^{^{\\circ}}$．<br>故选：D．"
