    "detail": "解：（1）证明：如图，连接$OD$．<br><img src=\"assets/images/ch30_1_2_l2_g_q15_img2.jpeg\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\"><br>$\\because BC$与$\\odot O$相切于点$D$，$\\therefore OD\\perp BC$．<br>又$\\because BD=CD$，$\\therefore OD$垂直平分$BC$，$\\therefore OB=OC$，$\\therefore \\angle OCB=\\angle B$．<br>又$\\because OA\\perp AC$且$OA$为$\\odot O$的半径，$\\therefore AC$与$\\odot O$相切于点$A$．<br>由切线长定理得$\\angle ACO=\\angle OCB$，$\\therefore \\angle B=\\angle ACO$．<br>（2）由（1）知$\\angle B=\\angle OCB=\\angle ACO$．<br>$\\because OA\\perp AC$，即$\\angle BAC=90^{^{\\circ}}$，在$Rt\\triangle ABC$中，$\\angle B+\\angle ACB=90^{^{\\circ}}$，<br>$\\therefore 3\\angle B=90^{^{\\circ}}$，$\\therefore \\angle B=30^{^{\\circ}}$，$\\therefore \\angle ACO=\\angle B=30^{^{\\circ}}$．<br>$\\because CA$、$CD$均与$\\odot O$相切，$\\therefore CA=CD=3$．<br>在$Rt\\triangle AOC$中，$\\angle OAC=90^{^{\\circ}}$，$\\angle ACO=30^{^{\\circ}}$，$\\therefore OC=2AO$，<br>$\\therefore AC=\\sqrt{OC^{2}-AO^{2}}=\\sqrt{3}AO$，$\\therefore OA=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}AC=\\sqrt{3}$，<br>$\\therefore AE=2OA=2\\sqrt{3}$．<br>在$Rt\\triangle ACE$中，$CE=\\sqrt{AE^{2}+AC^{2}}=\\sqrt{(2\\sqrt{3})^{2}+3^{2}}=\\sqrt{21}$．"
