    "detail": "解：（1）$\\because AB$、$BC$是$\\odot O$的切线，$\\therefore \\angle BDO=\\angle BEO=90^{^{\\circ}}$．<br>又$\\because \\angle DOE=130^{^{\\circ}}$，在四边形$BDOE$中，$\\angle B=360^{^{\\circ}}-90^{^{\\circ}}-90^{^{\\circ}}-130^{^{\\circ}}=50^{^{\\circ}}$．<br>$\\because \\angle A=90^{^{\\circ}}$，$\\therefore \\angle ACB=90^{^{\\circ}}-\\angle B=40^{^{\\circ}}$．<br>故答案为：$40^{^{\\circ}}$．<br>（2）如图，连接$OF$、$AO$、$BO$、$CO$，<br><img src=\"assets/images/ch30_2_g_q12_img2.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\"><br>$\\because AB$、$AC$、$BC$是$\\odot O$的切线，$\\therefore OD\\perp AB$，$OF\\perp AC$，$OE\\perp BC$，且$OD=OE=OF$．<br>$\\because AB=3$，$AC=4$，$\\angle BAC=90^{^{\\circ}}$，$\\therefore BC=\\sqrt{AB^{2}+AC^{2}}=\\sqrt{3^{2}+4^{2}}=5$．<br>$\\because S_{\\triangle ABC}=S_{\\triangle ABO}+S_{\\triangle ACO}+S_{\\triangle BOC}$，<br>$\\therefore \\frac{1}{2}AB\\cdot AC=\\frac{1}{2}AB\\cdot OD+\\frac{1}{2}AC\\cdot OF+\\frac{1}{2}BC\\cdot OE$，<br>即$3\\times 4=(3+4+5)OD$，解得$OD=1$，<br>$\\therefore \\odot O$的半径为$1$．"
