    "detail": "解：（1）证明：如图，连接$AO$、$AD$，<br><img src=\"assets/images/ch30_2_g_q15_img2.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\"><br>$\\because CD$是$\\odot O$的直径，$\\therefore \\angle CAD=90^{^{\\circ}}$．<br>$\\because \\angle B=60^{^{\\circ}}$，$\\therefore \\angle ADC=\\angle B=60^{^{\\circ}}$．<br>又$\\because AO=DO$，$\\therefore \\triangle AOD$是等边三角形，$\\therefore \\angle OAD=60^{^{\\circ}}$．<br>$\\because \\angle CAD=90^{^{\\circ}}$，$\\angle ADC=60^{^{\\circ}}$，$\\therefore \\angle ACP=30^{^{\\circ}}$．<br>又$\\because AP=AC$，$\\therefore \\angle P=\\angle ACP=30^{^{\\circ}}$，<br>$\\therefore \\angle PAD=\\angle ADC-\\angle P=60^{^{\\circ}}-30^{^{\\circ}}=30^{^{\\circ}}$，<br>$\\therefore \\angle PAO=\\angle PAD+\\angle OAD=30^{^{\\circ}}+60^{^{\\circ}}=90^{^{\\circ}}$，即$AO\\perp PA$．<br>又$\\because OA$是$\\odot O$的半径，$\\therefore PA$是$\\odot O$的切线．<br>（2）由（1）知$\\angle P=\\angle PAD=30^{^{\\circ}}$，$\\therefore AD=PD=3$．<br>在$Rt\\triangle CAD$中，$\\angle ACD=30^{^{\\circ}}$，$\\angle CAD=90^{^{\\circ}}$，$\\therefore CD=2AD=6$，即$\\odot O$的直径为$6$．<br>（3）如图，设$\\triangle ABC$的内心为$M$，连接$AM$、$CM$、$BM$，作$\\triangle AMC$的外接圆$\\odot N$，连接$AN$、$CN$、$ON$．<br><img src=\"assets/images/ch30_2_g_q15_img3.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\"><br>$\\because \\angle ABC=60^{^{\\circ}}$，$\\therefore \\angle BAC+\\angle BCA=120^{^{\\circ}}$．<br>$\\because AM$、$CM$分别平分$\\angle BAC$、$\\angle BCA$，$\\therefore \\angle MAC+\\angle MCA=60^{^{\\circ}}$，$\\therefore \\angle AMC=120^{^{\\circ}}$．<br>$\\therefore$点$M$在以$AC$为弦、$AC$所对圆周角为$120^{^{\\circ}}$的$\\odot N$上，且圆心角$\\angle ANC=120^{^{\\circ}}$，<br>$\\therefore \\angle ABC+\\angle ANC=180^{^{\\circ}}$，$\\therefore$点$N$在$\\odot O$上．<br>$\\because AN=CN$，$\\therefore \\angle CON=\\angle ABC=60^{^{\\circ}}$，又$ON=OC$，$\\therefore \\triangle OCN$是等边三角形，$\\therefore CN=OC=3$．<br>当点$B$在$CD$下方从点$D$运动到点$C$时，点$M$在$\\odot N$上运动所对圆心角为$\\angle CNB=90^{^{\\circ}}$（当$B$与$D$重合时$\\angle CND=90^{^{\\circ}}$），<br>$\\therefore \\triangle ABC$内心的运动路线长为$\\frac{90\\pi \\times 3}{180}=\\frac{3}{2}\\pi$．"
