    "detail": "解：如图，设$\\triangle ABC$的外接圆圆心为$O$，连接$AO$、$BO$、$DO$、$BI$，设$OD$交$BC$于点$E$．<br><img src=\"assets/images/ch30_2_t_q5_img2.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\"><br>$\\because$在$\\triangle ABC$中，$\\angle BAC=60^{^{\\circ}}$，点$I$为内心，$\\therefore AD$平分$\\angle BAC$，$\\therefore \\angle BAD=\\angle CAD=30^{^{\\circ}}$，<br>$\\therefore \\angle BOD=2\\angle BAD=60^{^{\\circ}}$．又$\\because OB=OD$，$\\therefore \\triangle OBD$是等边三角形，$\\therefore DB=OD=OB=OA$．<br>$\\because \\angle BAD=\\angle CAD=30^{^{\\circ}}$，$\\therefore \\overset{\\frown}{BD}=\\overset{\\frown}{CD}$，$\\therefore OD\\perp BC$，$BE=CE=\\frac{1}{2}BC=\\frac{3}{2}$．<br>$\\because \\angle CBD=\\angle CAD=30^{^{\\circ}}$，$\\therefore DE=BE\\cdot tan30^{^{\\circ}}=\\frac{3}{2}\\times \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$，$\\therefore DB=2DE=\\sqrt{3}$．<br>$\\because$点$I$是$\\triangle ABC$的内心，$\\therefore \\angle IBA=\\angle CBI$，<br>又$\\because \\angle DBI=\\angle DBC+\\angle CBI$，$\\angle DIB=\\angle IAB+\\angle IBA$，$\\angle DBC=\\angle IAB=30^{^{\\circ}}$，<br>$\\therefore \\angle DBI=\\angle DIB$，$\\therefore DI=DB=\\sqrt{3}$．<br>$\\because \\angle ABD=45^{^{\\circ}}$，$\\therefore \\angle AOD=2\\angle ABD=90^{^{\\circ}}$．<br>又$\\because OA=OD=DB=\\sqrt{3}$，$\\therefore AD=\\sqrt{2}OA=\\sqrt{6}$，<br>$\\therefore AI=AD-DI=\\sqrt{6}-\\sqrt{3}$．<br>故选：D．"
