    "detail": "解：（1）$\\because \\angle C=40^{^{\\circ}}$，$\\therefore \\angle ABC+\\angle BAC=180^{^{\\circ}}-40^{^{\\circ}}=140^{^{\\circ}}$．<br>$\\because \\odot O$为$\\triangle ABC$的内切圆，$\\therefore \\angle BAO=\\angle CAO$，$\\angle ABO=\\angle CBO$，<br>$\\therefore \\angle OAB+\\angle OBA=\\frac{1}{2}\\times 140^{^{\\circ}}=70^{^{\\circ}}$，<br>$\\therefore \\angle AOB=180^{^{\\circ}}-70^{^{\\circ}}=110^{^{\\circ}}$．<br>（2）如图，设$DE$与$\\odot O$的切点为$I$．<br><img src=\"assets/images/ch30_2_t_q12_img2.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\"><br>由切线长定理得$EH=EI$，$DI=DG$，<br>$\\therefore \\triangle CDE$的周长为$CD+CE+DE$<br>= $CD+CE+EI+DI$<br>= $CD+CE+EH+DG$<br>= $CG+CH$．<br>又$\\because AF=AH$，$BF=BG$，$CG=CH$，<br>$\\therefore CG+CH=(AB+BC+AC)-(AH+AF+BF+BG)$<br>= $8+6+9-2AB$<br>= $23-2\\times 6$<br>= $11$．"
