    "stem": "如图，$\\odot O$是$\\triangle ABC$的内切圆，其中$AB=7$，$BC=5$，$AC=8$，求其内切圆的半径．<br><img src=\"assets/images/ch30_2_t_q13_img1.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\">",
