    "detail": "解：如图，连接$OC$、$OD$，<br><img src=\"assets/images/ch30_3_l1_t_q2_img2.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\"><br>$\\because$六边形$ABCDEF$是正六边形，$\\therefore \\angle COD=\\frac{360^{^{\\circ}}}{6}=60^{^{\\circ}}$．<br>又$\\because OC=OD$，$\\therefore \\triangle COD$是等边三角形，$\\therefore OC=CD$．<br>$\\therefore$正六边形的周长与圆的直径之比为$\\frac{6CD}{2CD}=3$．<br>故选：A．"
