    "detail": "解：如图，设中间正六边形为$MNTQPG$，连接$MQ$、$PN$，过点$O$作$OH\\perp MN$于点$H$，<br><img src=\"assets/images/ch30_3_l1_t_q12_img2.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\"><br>$\\because$六边形$MNTQPG$是正六边形，且最长对角线$MQ=PN=4cm$，<br>$\\therefore OM=ON=2cm$，$\\angle MON=\\frac{360^{^{\\circ}}}{6}=60^{^{\\circ}}$，$\\therefore \\triangle MON$是等边三角形，$\\therefore MN=2cm$．<br>$\\because OH\\perp MN$，$\\therefore MH=NH=1cm$，<br>$\\therefore OH=\\sqrt{ON^{2}-NH^{2}}=\\sqrt{2^{2}-1^{2}}=\\sqrt{3}(cm)$，<br>$\\therefore S_{\\triangle MON}=\\frac{1}{2}MN\\cdot OH=\\frac{1}{2}\\times 2\\times \\sqrt{3}=\\sqrt{3}(cm^{2})$，<br>$\\therefore S_{正六边形MNTQPG}=6S_{\\triangle MON}=6\\sqrt{3}(cm^{2})$．<br>又$\\because \\odot O$的直径为$8cm$，$\\therefore S_{\\odot O}=\\pi \\times 4^{2}=16\\pi (cm^{2})$，<br>$\\therefore S_{阴影}=(16\\pi -6\\sqrt{3})cm^{2}$．<br>故答案为：$16\\pi -6\\sqrt{3}$．"
