    "detail": "解：（1）过点$O$作直径$AC$，再作线段$AC$的垂直平分线交$\\odot O$于点$B$、$D$，顺次连接$A$、$B$、$C$、$D$，正方形$ABCD$即为所求，如图所示．<br><img src=\"assets/images/ch30_3_l2_b_q11_img2.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\"><br>说明：$\\because BD$是$AC$的垂直平分线，$\\therefore \\angle AOB=\\angle BOC=\\angle COD=\\angle AOD=90^{^{\\circ}}$，$AB=BC=CD=AD$，四边形$ABCD$为菱形；又$\\because AC$为直径，$\\therefore \\angle ABC=90^{^{\\circ}}$，故四边形$ABCD$为正方形．<br>（2）$\\because \\odot O$的半径为$4$，四边形$ABCD$是正方形，$\\therefore AC\\perp BD$，$OA=OB=4$，<br>$\\therefore AB=\\sqrt{OA^{2}+OB^{2}}=\\sqrt{4^{2}+4^{2}}=4\\sqrt{2}$，即正方形$ABCD$的边长为$4\\sqrt{2}$．"
