    "detail": "解：（1）过点$O$作直径$AD$，以点$D$为圆心、$DO$长为半径画弧，交$\\odot O$于$B$、$C$两点；顺次连接$A$、$B$、$C$，则$\\triangle ABC$即为$\\odot O$的内接正三角形，如图所示．<br><img src=\"assets/images/ch30_3_l2_b_q12_img2.png\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\"><br>（2）如图，连接$OB$，设$BC$交$AD$于点$E$．<br>由作法知$OB=OD=BD=2$，$\\therefore \\triangle OBD$是等边三角形，$\\therefore \\angle BOD=60^{^{\\circ}}$．<br>同理$\\angle COD=60^{^{\\circ}}$，$\\therefore AD\\perp BC$且$BE=CE$．<br>在$Rt\\triangle OBE$中，$\\angle BOE=60^{^{\\circ}}$，$\\therefore OE=\\frac{1}{2}OB=1$，$BE=\\sqrt{OB^{2}-OE^{2}}=\\sqrt{2^{2}-1^{2}}=\\sqrt{3}$，<br>$\\therefore BC=2BE=2\\sqrt{3}$，$AE=OA+OE=2+1=3$，<br>$\\therefore S_{\\triangle ABC}=\\frac{1}{2}BC\\cdot AE=\\frac{1}{2}\\times 2\\sqrt{3}\\times 3=3\\sqrt{3}$．"
