    "detail": "解：（1）在$\\odot O$上任取一点$A$，以$OA$长为半径依次在$\\odot O$上截取点$B$、$C$、$D$、$E$、$F$，顺次连接各分点，则正六边形$ABCDEF$即为所求，如图所示．<br><img src=\"assets/images/ch30_3_l2_b_q15_img2.jpeg\" class=\"my-2 max-w-xs h-auto rounded\" alt=\"题目配图\"><br>（2）如图，连接$OA$、$OB$，过点$O$作$OH\\perp AB$于点$H$．<br>$\\because$六边形$ABCDEF$是圆内接正六边形，$\\therefore \\angle AOB=\\frac{360^{^{\\circ}}}{6}=60^{^{\\circ}}$，$OA=OB$，<br>$\\therefore \\triangle OAB$是等边三角形，$\\therefore OA=OB=AB=3$．<br>$\\because OH\\perp AB$，$\\therefore BH=\\frac{1}{2}AB=\\frac{3}{2}$，<br>$\\therefore OH=\\sqrt{OB^{2}-BH^{2}}=\\sqrt{3^{2}-\\left(\\frac{3}{2}\\right)^{2}}=\\frac{3\\sqrt{3}}{2}$，即正六边形的边心距为$\\frac{3\\sqrt{3}}{2}$．"
